    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Warp Dash</strong>, a high-speed 3D endless runner set in a fractured multiverse. You play as a mysterious cubicle traveler, launched from another dimension and trapped in a hostile alien world that stretches infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a new adventure \u2014 procedurally generated environments ensure no two dashes are the same. With tight controls, beautiful low-poly visuals, and an atmospheric soundtrack, <i>Warp Dash</i> delivers adrenaline-fueled gameplay with a sense of wonder and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you outrun the void... or become part of it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20 <strong>Endless Challenge:</strong> Procedurally generated paths keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Smooth Controls:</strong> Designed for fast reflexes and fluid movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Collect &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Earn warp coins to unlock new abilities and skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Stylized Worlds:</strong> Explore beautiful alien landscapes with a sci-fi twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for the highest scores with players worldwide.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Warp Dash</strong>, a high-speed 3D endless runner set in a fractured multiverse. You play as a mysterious cubicle traveler, launched from another dimension and trapped in a hostile alien world that stretches infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a new adventure \u2014 procedurally generated environments ensure no two dashes are the same. With tight controls, beautiful low-poly visuals, and an atmospheric soundtrack, <i>Warp Dash</i> delivers adrenaline-fueled gameplay with a sense of wonder and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you outrun the void... or become part of it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20 <strong>Endless Challenge:</strong> Procedurally generated paths keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Smooth Controls:</strong> Designed for fast reflexes and fluid movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Collect &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Earn warp coins to unlock new abilities and skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Stylized Worlds:</strong> Explore beautiful alien landscapes with a sci-fi twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for the highest scores with players worldwide.</p></li></ul>",
